hadiths[3]{hadithnumber,text}:
"27551","Abd al-Rahman ibn Mahdi narrated to us, he said: Sufyan narrated to me, from Mansur, from Ribi, from his wife, from the sister of Hudhayfah, she said: The Messenger of Allah, peace and blessings of Allah be upon him, addressed us and said: O assembly of women, do you not have in silver what to adorn yourselves with? Verily, there is no woman among you who adorns herself with gold and displays it except she will be punished with it."
"27552","Muhammad ibn Jafar narrated to us, he said: Shubah narrated to us, from Mansur, from Ribi ibn Hirash, from his wife, from the sister of Khudhayfah, she said: The Messenger of Allah, peace and blessings of Allah be upon him, addressed us and mentioned the like of it."
"27553","Abd al-Razzaq narrated to us, he said: Sufyan informed us, from Mansur, from Ribi, from his wife, from the sister of Hudhayfah - and he had sisters who had met the Prophet, peace and blessings of Allah be upon him - she said: The Prophet, peace and blessings of Allah be upon him, addressed us and said: O assembly of women, do you not have in silver what to adorn yourselves with? Verily, there is no woman among you who adorns herself with gold and displays it except she will be punished with it."
